<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Investec in talks to buy UK stockbroker.</title>
<headline>Investec in talks to buy UK stockbroker.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Investec Bank Ltd said on Wednesday it is in advanced talks to buy Carr Sheppards, a British portfolio management stockbroker with more than 2.5 billion stg in funds under management or advice.</p>
<p>The firm is currently owned by Banque Indosuez.</p>
</text>
